  "problem_statement": "NameError: name 'zip_longest' is not defined in interleave function\n\n#### Description\n\nThe `interleave` function is broken and raises a `NameError` when called.\n\n#### Steps/Code to Reproduce\n\n```python\nfrom funcy import interleave\n\n# This should work but raises NameError\nresult = list(interleave('ab', 'cd'))\nprint(result)  # Expected: ['a', 'c', 'b', 'd']\n```\n\n#### Error\n\n```\nNameError: name 'zip_longest' is not defined\n```\n\nThe function seems to be trying to use `zip_longest` but it's not imported anywhere in the module."
